✓ Joined Home Wi-Fi.

✗ This PC is talking to itself.

This PC still holds the other PC's address 192.168.137.1 on its own Wi-Fi Direct
adapter, left over from its own Mobile Hotspot, so it is talking to itself.
Devpit can take that address off (one administrator prompt); Windows puts it
back the next time this PC turns on its own hotspot.

Press f to fix it, then Devpit checks again.

[keys] f fix it  ·  enter check again  ·  b back to my Wi-Fi
